                <head>No. 664.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to General Sickles.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 29,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Remain at post. Further instructions soon. Settlement being effected here.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
